<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] · micoempresa</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.13.1/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body class="auth-page">
    <div class="auth-split">
        <aside class="auth-marca">
            <div class="brand">
                <div class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">m</div>
                <strong>micoempresa</strong>
            </div>
            <h2>Nota fiscal de serviço sem complicação para a sua empresa.</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Emita NFS-e no padrão nacional em segundos, direto na SEFIN.</span></li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-calendar-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Nota Mensal: todos os contratos do mês faturados de uma vez.</span></li>
                <li><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Reajuste por IPCA, IGP-M e outros índices, calculado sozinho no aniversário.</span></li>
            </ul>
            <small>micoempresa.com.br</small>
        </aside>
        <main class="auth-form">
            <div class="auth-form-inner">
                <div class="card auth-card">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        @RenderBody()
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="auth-legal">
                    <a href="/termos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Termos de uso</a>
                    <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                    <a href="/privacidade" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Política de privacidade</a>
                </p>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@@popperjs/core@2.11.8/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
    <script src="~/js/site.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>

    @await RenderSectionAsync("Scripts", required: false)
</body>
</html>
